{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_title", "source_sha256": "108d258508b951876f42b7f9c264a14fa6ff4e63673e53b0d8626e4f7ca97bf9", "ja": "貴音と舞台裏", "zh": "贵音与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_synopsis", "source_sha256": "64d3db5103d2cab5cc9dec73c0c7f7a6636861906419a4d9502d17754e03431b", "ja": "貴音との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是与贵音在后台发生的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1000_null", "source_sha256": "063a53b5875d4475ed117a10d366bc5f946de7fb8b1830bb3a1a2579cfd65464", "ja": "『ツアー会場近郊スポット紹介』撮影終了後……", "zh": "“巡演会场周边景点介绍”拍摄结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1001_402cpr", "source_sha256": "2360fec034fd21869bc1bffad4a8134670717cb713912352d934478404ae46a5", "ja": "お疲れ様。レポート、お店の人たちに大好評\nだったぞ！　ツアーの宣伝もできたし、さすがだな。", "zh": "辛苦了。报告大受店家们好评  \n啊！也宣传了巡演，真不愧是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "1c0e38b2bc26cc2cc73cfd60dfffeb9e62638f8e4d92c9a795fb761fb8decfc7", "ja": "恐れ入ります。アイドルとしての務め、\nつつがなく果たすことができたようですね。", "zh": "承蒙夸奖。看来作为偶像的职责，我也顺利完成了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "b12cd250d40108da2a6338c0cb4c312d403c2f94de9118e2ab628a4b7b920e30", "ja": "ですが、それは皆が私とともに歩み、手本を見せて\nくれたおかげ。私ひとりの手柄ではありません。", "zh": "不过，那是因为大家和我一同前行，为我做出了表率。并非我一人的功劳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1004_402cpr", "source_sha256": "504ae426430bdae3d109e458d8153580c7b3896997f160e79a072a9f336a7b18", "ja": "みんなのおかげか。たぶん、他のみんなもそう思って\nるよ。……まあ、一番は俺って気もするけど。", "zh": "大家的光劳啊。大概其他所有人也都是这么想的\n吧。……不过，总觉得最该感谢的还是我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "616fa044edd1512c95f342f2d602b20072a78f121730cdd3af68aba342c440ad", "ja": "ふふっ。そう思われるのは、あなた様が私達とともに\n歩んでくださった、何よりの証ですね。", "zh": "呵呵。您能这样想，正是您陪伴我们一路走来的最好证明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "6c2529e127ff0acc6ea19d0814d54dc965e700d85d80c9bcd879eb3c26ec6177", "ja": "歩みの速さも行き先も、少しずつ違う。\nそんな私達、ひとりひとりと共に……。", "zh": "步伐的快慢和前往的方向，也都各不相同。\n就这样，与我们每一个人一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "bd4e2f71f539f864a61fadbebb5e2157eb7fb16f78bb0ca3e5cea0ab770d090c", "ja": "……。そっか。", "zh": "……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "418717b29236ff37571ff38cb361dab87b730eade667c0b6ee12952ba47c839f", "ja": "私達にとってのあなた様のように……。\nこのツアーからの彼女達には、あの方が？", "zh": "就如同您之于我们……对于从这次巡演开始的她们来说，那位大人也是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1009_402cpr", "source_sha256": "d0c37877a67ce90d96b55597e70850cddda860b6ae5396aa87fb306e9686dd2e", "ja": "うん、期待してる。まだまだこれからだけど、\nアイツなら……。あ、本人には内緒な？", "zh": "嗯，很期待啊。虽然现在才刚刚起步，\n但要是那家伙的话……啊，可别告诉本人哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_008tak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_008tak_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "c7064622cb7bf711a2bc22e9893fdbac6d2b887e8aca871d0587c1b6ee7bea72", "ja": "まあ。真、いけずなお方です……、ふふっ！", "zh": "哎呀，真是个坏心眼的人……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
